{"run_id": "41479fd77ef948d9afe66d7963d0f66f", "sequence": 4, "time": "2026-10-29T16:40:18.118879+00:00", "event": "tool_result", "call_id": "c01-1-0", "name": "search_documents", "observation": {"ok": true, "mode": "hybrid", "hits": [{"doc_id": "D02", "version_date": "2026-03-01", "chunk_id": "c005", "title": "费用报销制度乙", "topic": "报销期限", "scope": "未说明", "status": "未说明", "parent_id": "r005", "related_ids": [], "heading_path": ["费用报销制度乙", "第五条提交期限"], "token_count": 212, "kind": "text", "table_id": null, "row_id": null, "quality_warnings": [], "source_locations": [{"file_id": "D02-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_scanned/D02_费用报销制度乙_模拟扫描.pdf", "sha256": "545aa231842caf089edb81acf5afb59034f885fca9c050d28d312c53f0902bd2", "method": "ocr", "page": 2, "bbox": [48.646304321289065, 182.91431884765626, 135.7866455078125, 196.494970703125], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": 0.9998433079038348}, {"file_id": "D02-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_scanned/D02_费用报销制度乙_模拟扫描.pdf", "sha256": "545aa231842caf089edb81acf5afb59034f885fca9c050d28d312c53f0902bd2", "method": "ocr", "page": 2, "bbox": [48.646304321289065, 211.3488037109375, 541.8775390625, 240.6320556640625], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": 0.998851158789226}, {"file_id": "D02-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_scanned/D02_费用报销制度乙_模拟扫描.pdf", "sha256": "545aa231842caf089edb81acf5afb59034f885fca9c050d28d312c53f0902bd2", "method": "ocr", "page": 2, "bbox": [49.06931762695312, 254.637109375, 542.300537109375, 285.1935546875], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": 0.9989627904362148}], "snippet": "第五条提交期限\n\n报销期限为费用发生后15个自然日。本文未说明适用部门，也未说明是否替代其他报销制度。自然日包括周末和节假日，申请人不应自行改为工作日口径。申请材料应如实列明费用发生日期及提交日期。\n\n本资料未定义首日是否计入、截止时刻以及节假日顺延。若用户要求计算精确的最迟提交日，应先确认这些口径；本文只能支持“费用发生后15个自然日”的原则性表述，不能支", "rrf_score": 0.032787, "bm25_score": 4.03848, "vector_score": 0.649217}, {"doc_id": "D02", "version_date": "2026-03-01", "chunk_id": "c006", "title": "费用报销制度乙", "topic": "报销期限", "scope": "未说明", "status": "未说明", "parent_id": "r006", "related_ids": [], "heading_path": ["费用报销制度乙", "第六条日期登记"], "token_count": 216, "kind": "text", "table_id": null, "row_id": null, "quality_warnings": [], "source_locations": [{"file_id": "D02-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_scanned/D02_费用报销制度乙_模拟扫描.pdf", "sha256": "545aa231842caf089edb81acf5afb59034f885fca9c050d28d312c53f0902bd2", "method": "ocr", "page": 2, "bbox": [48.22329406738281, 303.866943359375, 134.51761474609376, 317.8719970703125], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": 0.9998874068260193}, {"file_id": "D02-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_scanned/D02_费用报销制度乙_模拟扫描.pdf", "sha256": "545aa231842caf089edb81acf5afb59034f885fca9c050d28d312c53f0902bd2", "method": "ocr", "page": 2, "bbox": [49.06931762695312, 331.0282470703125, 541.8775390625, 362.00908203125], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": 0.9988648295402527}, {"file_id": "D02-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_scanned/D02_费用报销制度乙_模拟扫描.pdf", "sha256": "545aa231842caf089edb81acf5afb59034f885fca9c050d28d312c53f0902bd2", "method": "ocr", "page": 2, "bbox": [48.646304321289065, 375.16533203125, 541.454541015625, 405.7218017578125], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": 0.9990764082746303}], "snippet": "第六条日期登记\n\n申请单应分别登记实际费用发生日期、发票开具日期、支付日期和首次提交日期。发票晚开、银行晚入账或月底汇总，不自动改变费用发生日期。不得通过拆单、修改发生日期或删除原申请来规避提交要求。\n\n同一批提交包含多笔费用时，应逐项列出日期。住宿跨日、预付款与尾款分离或订单部分取消时，费用发生日期可能需要进一步核定；本文没有规定这些交易的统一起算规则，应", "rrf_score": 0.032002, "bm25_score": 3.413601, "vector_score": 0.646562}, {"doc_id": "D01", "version_date": "2026-01-01", "chunk_id": "c005", "title": "费用报销制度甲", "topic": "报销期限", "scope": "未说明", "status": "未说明", "parent_id": "r005", "related_ids": [], "heading_path": ["费用报销制度甲", "第五条 报销提交期限"], "token_count": 237, "kind": "text", "table_id": null, "row_id": null, "quality_warnings": [], "source_locations": [{"file_id": "D01-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_native/D01_费用报销制度甲_原生.pdf", "sha256": "e44b5b4ce13137c381e6910f5304e7b8a583e6dd84756e9c49fdf5520fcd7933", "method": "pdf_text", "page": 2, "bbox": [48.0, 184.6171875, 157.25, 196.1171875], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": null}, {"file_id": "D01-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_native/D01_费用报销制度甲_原生.pdf", "sha256": "e44b5b4ce13137c381e6910f5304e7b8a583e6dd84756e9c49fdf5520fcd7933", "method": "pdf_text", "page": 2, "bbox": [48.0, 211.4765625, 541.5, 256.9765625], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": null}, {"file_id": "D01-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_native/D01_费用报销制度甲_原生.pdf", "sha256": "e44b5b4ce13137c381e6910f5304e7b8a583e6dd84756e9c49fdf5520fcd7933", "method": "pdf_text", "page": 2, "bbox": [48.0, 272.9765625, 541.5, 318.4765625], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": null}], "snippet": "第五条 报销提交期限\n\n报销期限为费用发生后30个自然日。报销申请应提交发票和费用说明。自然日包含周末和节假日，不能直接理解为30个工作日。本文未给出节假日顺延、超期豁免或跨年度延期的批准规则；遇到这些情形时，需要补充制度依据。\n\n申请单应分别记录费用发生日期、实际支付日期、发票开具日期与系统提交日期。不同日期可能不一致，不能为了使申请落在期限内而修改真实日", "rrf_score": 0.031754, "bm25_score": 3.803838, "vector_score": 0.621793}, {"doc_id": "D01", "version_date": "2026-01-01", "chunk_id": "c014", "title": "费用报销制度甲", "topic": "报销期限", "scope": "未说明", "status": "未说明", "parent_id": "r014", "related_ids": [], "heading_path": ["费用报销制度甲", "第十四条 关于期限的问答"], "token_count": 217, "kind": "text", "table_id": null, "row_id": null, "quality_warnings": [], "source_locations": [{"file_id": "D01-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_native/D01_费用报销制度甲_原生.pdf", "sha256": "e44b5b4ce13137c381e6910f5304e7b8a583e6dd84756e9c49fdf5520fcd7933", "method": "pdf_text", "page": 4, "bbox": [48.0, 323.1171875, 180.25, 334.6171875], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": null}, {"file_id": "D01-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_native/D01_费用报销制度甲_原生.pdf", "sha256": "e44b5b4ce13137c381e6910f5304e7b8a583e6dd84756e9c49fdf5520fcd7933", "method": "pdf_text", "page": 4, "bbox": [48.0, 349.9765625, 541.5, 377.9765625], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": null}, {"file_id": "D01-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_native/D01_费用报销制度甲_原生.pdf", "sha256": "e44b5b4ce13137c381e6910f5304e7b8a583e6dd84756e9c49fdf5520fcd7933", "method": "pdf_text", "page": 4, "bbox": [48.0, 393.9765625, 541.5, 421.9765625], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": null}], "snippet": "第十四条 关于期限的问答\n\n问：拿到发票后是否重新计算30天？答：本制度写明费用发生后30个自然日，未写明收到发票后重新起算，不能自行改变口径。问：遇到周末可否自动顺延？答：本文未规定顺延，需要补充依据。\n\n问：另一份文件规定15天，应采用哪一个？答：本制度未说明与其他制度的优先关系，也未提供范围清单。应核对双方适用范围、有效性及批准文件；不能仅以日期较新、", "rrf_score": 0.031025, "bm25_score": 2.988985, "vector_score": 0.626471}, {"doc_id": "D01", "version_date": "2026-01-01", "chunk_id": "c006", "title": "费用报销制度甲", "topic": "报销期限", "scope": "未说明", "status": "未说明", "parent_id": "r006", "related_ids": [], "heading_path": ["费用报销制度甲", "第六条 分批费用与日期不明确事项"], "token_count": 249, "kind": "text", "table_id": null, "row_id": null, "quality_warnings": [], "source_locations": [{"file_id": "D01-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_native/D01_费用报销制度甲_原生.pdf", "sha256": "e44b5b4ce13137c381e6910f5304e7b8a583e6dd84756e9c49fdf5520fcd7933", "method": "pdf_text", "page": 2, "bbox": [48.0, 340.6171875, 226.25, 352.1171875], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": null}, {"file_id": "D01-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_native/D01_费用报销制度甲_原生.pdf", "sha256": "e44b5b4ce13137c381e6910f5304e7b8a583e6dd84756e9c49fdf5520fcd7933", "method": "pdf_text", "page": 2, "bbox": [48.0, 367.4765625, 541.5, 412.9765625], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": null}, {"file_id": "D01-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_native/D01_费用报销制度甲_原生.pdf", "sha256": "e44b5b4ce13137c381e6910f5304e7b8a583e6dd84756e9c49fdf5520fcd7933", "method": "pdf_text", "page": 2, "bbox": [48.0, 428.9765625, 552.0, 456.9765625], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": null}], "snippet": "第六条 分批费用与日期不明确事项\n\n同一项目的多笔费用应逐笔填写发生日期。一次性合并提交不能将所有费用改记为最后一笔的日期，也不能将补开发票日期自动作为费用发生日期。住宿连续多晚、预付款与尾款跨期等情形，如发生日期存在争议，应在申请中说明并请适用制度负责人确认。\n\n外币费用、取消后重新支付的订单、部分退款和跨月结算需要附交易过程说明。本文没有规定汇率取值日期", "rrf_score": 0.03009, "bm25_score": 3.233281, "vector_score": 0.606722}, {"doc_id": "D04", "version_date": "2026-02-01", "chunk_id": "c012", "title": "出差住宿规则", "topic": "住宿", "scope": "国内出差", "status": "有效", "parent_id": "r012", "related_ids": ["r005", "r038", "r039", "r040", "r041"], "heading_path": ["出差住宿规则", "表A"], "token_count": 103, "kind": "table_row", "table_id": "table01", "row_id": "T07", "quality_warnings": [], "source_locations": [{"file_id": "D04-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_native/D04_出差住宿规则_跨页表格.pdf", "sha256": "c9384bbeeca21f469c6efc510eee893d76d2fff002f0e681c5bfeeb28a2a97d6", "method": "pdf_table", "page": 2, "bbox": [48.0, 447.0, 96.0, 477.5], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": null}, {"file_id": "D04-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_native/D04_出差住宿规则_跨页表格.pdf", "sha256": "c9384bbeeca21f469c6efc510eee893d76d2fff002f0e681c5bfeeb28a2a97d6", "method": "pdf_table", "page": 2, "bbox": [96.0, 447.0, 148.0, 477.5], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": null}, {"file_id": "D04-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_native/D04_出差住宿规则_跨页表格.pdf", "sha256": "c9384bbeeca21f469c6efc510eee893d76d2fff002f0e681c5bfeeb28a2a97d6", "method": "pdf_table", "page": 2, "bbox": [148.0, 447.0, 209.0, 477.5], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": null}, {"file_id": "D04-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_native/D04_出差住宿规则_跨页表格.pdf", "sha256": "c9384bbeeca21f469c6efc510eee893d76d2fff002f0e681c5bfeeb28a2a97d6", "method": "pdf_table", "page": 2, "bbox": [209.0, 447.0, 245.0, 477.5], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": null}, {"file_id": "D04-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_native/D04_出差住宿规则_跨页表格.pdf", "sha256": "c9384bbeeca21f469c6efc510eee893d76d2fff002f0e681c5bfeeb28a2a97d6", "method": "pdf_table", "page": 2, "bbox": [245.0, 447.0, 547.0, 477.5], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": null}], "snippet": "T07 | 苏州 | 国内出差 | 350 | 发生退款时保留原订单与退款凭据，申请金额应说明退款后的实际支出。", "rrf_score": 0.015625, "bm25_score": 3.348889, "vector_score": 0.465835}]}}
